# Generic suppression for glibc TLS allocation in all threads.
# The thread-local storage allocated by glibc during pthread_create is reported
# as "possibly lost" when threads are still running at exit or their stacks have
# not yet been reclaimed. This is a well-known false positive.
{
   <glibc_tls_possibly_lost>
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: possible
   fun:calloc
   fun:calloc
   fun:allocate_dtv
   fun:_dl_allocate_tls
   fun:allocate_stack
   fun:pthread_create@@GLIBC_2.34
   ...
}
